    "timestampMs": 260513,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "是 IFileSystem。",
    "startMs": 263310,
    "endMs": 265448,
    "timestampMs": 263310,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "命令不会直接调用 Node 的 fs，",
    "startMs": 265448,
    "endMs": 268409,
    "timestampMs": 265448,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而是依赖 readFile、",
    "startMs": 268409,
    "endMs": 270548,
    "timestampMs": 268409,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "writeFile、",
    "startMs": 270548,
    "endMs": 272028,
    "timestampMs": 270548,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "stat、",
    "startMs": 272028,
    "endMs": 272686,
    "timestampMs": 272028,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "mkdir、",
    "startMs": 272686,
    "endMs": 273509,
    "timestampMs": 272686,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "readdir、",
    "startMs": 273509,
    "endMs": 274661,
    "timestampMs": 273509,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "软链接等统一接口。",
    "startMs": 274661,
    "endMs": 275977,
    "timestampMs": 274661,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "默认的 InMemoryFs 完全位于内存，",
    "startMs": 275977,
    "endMs": 279431,
    "timestampMs": 275977,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "宿主磁盘对它来说根本不存在。",
    "startMs": 279431,
    "endMs": 281570,
    "timestampMs": 279431,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "OverlayFs 可以读取真实目录，",
    "startMs": 281570,
    "endMs": 284531,
    "timestampMs": 281570,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "但把修改保留在内存，",
    "startMs": 284531,
    "endMs": 286012,
    "timestampMs": 284531,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "适合让 Agent 检查代码而不破坏工作区。",
    "startMs": 286012,
    "endMs": 289466,
    "timestampMs": 286012,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "ReadWriteFs 才会把写操作落到指定目录，",
    "startMs": 289466,
    "endMs": 293414,
    "timestampMs": 289466,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "所以它必须指向专门的沙箱工作区。",
    "startMs": 293414,
    "endMs": 295882,
    "timestampMs": 293414,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "MountableFs 则能把多个文件系统挂载到不同路径。",
    "startMs": 295882,
    "endMs": 300488,
    "timestampMs": 295882,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "注意一个容易忽略的细节：",
    "startMs": 300488,
    "endMs": 302298,
    "timestampMs": 300488,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "每次 exec 的 Shell 状态相互隔离，",
    "startMs": 302298,
    "endMs": 305917,
    "timestampMs": 302298,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "但文件系统可以共享。",
    "startMs": 305917,
    "endMs": 307397,
    "timestampMs": 305917,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "因此上一次命令写出的文件，下一次依然能够读取。",
    "startMs": 307397,
    "endMs": 310852,
    "timestampMs": 307397,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "再看最有 Shell 味道的部分：管道。",
    "startMs": 312052,
    "endMs": 315409,
    "timestampMs": 312052,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "JustBash 会按顺序执行管道节点，",
    "startMs": 315409,
    "endMs": 318953,
    "timestampMs": 315409,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "把上一个命令的 stdout 变成下一个命令的 stdin；",
    "startMs": 318953,
    "endMs": 324361,
    "timestampMs": 318953,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "普通竖线不会吞掉 stderr，",
    "startMs": 324361,
    "endMs": 327159,
    "timestampMs": 324361,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而竖线加与号会把两者合并。",
    "startMs": 327159,
    "endMs": 329397,
    "timestampMs": 327159,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "为了支持压缩包等二进制数据，",
    "startMs": 329397,
    "endMs": 331822,
    "timestampMs": 329397,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "内部管道不是靠内容猜编码，",
    "startMs": 331822,
    "endMs": 334060,
    "timestampMs": 331822,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而是由生产者声明输出类型，",
    "startMs": 334060,
    "endMs": 336298,
    "timestampMs": 334060,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "再以字节形态向后传递。",
    "startMs": 336298,
    "endMs": 338163,
    "timestampMs": 336298,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "重定向模块则把大于号、",
    "startMs": 338163,
    "endMs": 340028,
    "timestampMs": 338163,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "追加、",
    "startMs": 340028,
    "endMs": 340478,
    "timestampMs": 340028,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "标准错误和输入文件映射到文件系统操作。",
    "startMs": 340478,
    "endMs": 343835,
    "timestampMs": 340478,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "与此同时，",
    "startMs": 343835,
    "endMs": 344581,
    "timestampMs": 343835,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "解释器记录每个环节的 PIPESTATUS，",
    "startMs": 344581,
    "endMs": 348498,
    "timestampMs": 344581,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "并根据 pipefail 决定最终退出码。",
    "startMs": 348498,
    "endMs": 352228,
    "timestampMs": 348498,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "换句话说，",
    "startMs": 352228,
    "endMs": 352974,
    "timestampMs": 352228,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "屏幕上看似简单的一条命令，",
    "startMs": 352974,
    "endMs": 355212,
    "timestampMs": 352974,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "内部其实是一张带类型和状态的异步数据流图。",
    "startMs": 355212,
    "endMs": 358865,
    "timestampMs": 355212,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "虚拟实现不等于绝对安全，",
    "startMs": 360065,
    "endMs": 362213,
    "timestampMs": 360065,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "所以 JustBash 采用分层防御。",
    "startMs": 362213,
    "endMs": 365728,
    "timestampMs": 362213,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第一层是能力最小化：",
    "startMs": 365728,
    "endMs": 367486,
    "timestampMs": 365728,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "网络默认关闭，",
    "startMs": 367486,
    "endMs": 368657,
    "timestampMs": 367486,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "curl 只有在宿主提供网络配置时才出现，",
    "startMs": 368657,
    "endMs": 372563,
    "timestampMs": 368657,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而且可以限制 URL 前缀和 HTTP 方法。",
    "startMs": 372563,
    "endMs": 376859,
    "timestampMs": 372563,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第二层是资源限制，",
    "startMs": 376859,
    "endMs": 378421,
    "timestampMs": 376859,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "包括命令数量、",
    "startMs": 378421,
    "endMs": 379593,
    "timestampMs": 378421,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "循环次数、",
    "startMs": 379593,
    "endMs": 380374,
    "timestampMs": 379593,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "调用深度、",
    "startMs": 380374,
    "endMs": 381155,
    "timestampMs": 380374,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "解析深度和最大输出。",
    "startMs": 381155,
    "endMs": 382912,
    "timestampMs": 381155,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第三层是数据结构防御。",
    "startMs": 382912,
    "endMs": 384865,
    "timestampMs": 382912,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "环境变量等用户可控键使用 Map 或无原型对象，",
    "startMs": 384865,
    "endMs": 389357,
    "timestampMs": 384865,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "减少原型污染。",
    "startMs": 389357,
    "endMs": 390528,
    "timestampMs": 389357,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "可选的 JavaScript 和 Python 运行时默认关闭，",
    "startMs": 390528,
    "endMs": 396582,
    "timestampMs": 390528,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "因为它们会扩大攻击面。",
    "startMs": 396582,
    "endMs": 398535,
    "timestampMs": 396582,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "还有 defense in depth，",
    "startMs": 398535,
    "endMs": 402245,
    "timestampMs": 398535,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "在执行期间屏蔽危险的 JavaScript 全局对象。",
    "startMs": 402245,
    "endMs": 407322,
    "timestampMs": 402245,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "但项目也明确说明：",
    "startMs": 407322,
    "endMs": 408884,
    "timestampMs": 407322,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "它是第二道防线，",
    "startMs": 408884,
    "endMs": 410251,
    "timestampMs": 408884,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "不能替代真正的进程、",
    "startMs": 410251,
    "endMs": 412009,
    "timestampMs": 410251,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "容器或平台级隔离。",
    "startMs": 412009,
    "endMs": 413571,
    "timestampMs": 412009,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "理解 JustBash 也要理解它的边界。",
    "startMs": 414771,
    "endMs": 418469,
    "timestampMs": 414771,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "它追求的是对 Agent 常用工作流足够高的 Bash 兼容度，",
    "startMs": 418469,
    "endMs": 424202,
    "timestampMs": 418469,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而不是复刻完整 Linux 内核。",
    "startMs": 424202,
    "endMs": 427160,
    "timestampMs": 424202,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "文件操作、",
    "startMs": 427160,
    "endMs": 427900,
    "timestampMs": 427160,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "文本处理、",
    "startMs": 427900,
    "endMs": 428639,
    "timestampMs": 427900,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "JSON、",
    "startMs": 428639,
    "endMs": 429379,
    "timestampMs": 428639,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "CSV、",
    "startMs": 429379,
    "endMs": 429934,
    "timestampMs": 429379,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "SQLite、",
    "startMs": 429934,
    "endMs": 431043,
    "timestampMs": 429934,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "压缩和常见脚本语法已经覆盖得很广，",
    "startMs": 431043,
    "endMs": 434002,
    "timestampMs": 431043,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "但命令和边缘行为仍然需要逐项实现。",
    "startMs": 434002,
    "endMs": 436961,
    "timestampMs": 434002,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "项目大量使用 comparison tests，",
    "startMs": 436961,
    "endMs": 441214,
    "timestampMs": 436961,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "把同一个脚本同时交给真实 Bash 和 JustBash，",
    "startMs": 441214,
    "endMs": 446391,
    "timestampMs": 441214,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "再比较标准输出、",
    "startMs": 446391,
    "endMs": 447686,
    "timestampMs": 446391,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "标准错误和退出码。",
    "startMs": 447686,
    "endMs": 449165,
    "timestampMs": 447686,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "这种测试方式很重要，",
    "startMs": 449165,
    "endMs": 450829,
    "timestampMs": 449165,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "因为 Shell 的兼容性经常藏在引号、",
    "startMs": 450829,
    "endMs": 454342,
    "timestampMs": 450829,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "重定向顺序和错误处理里。",
    "startMs": 454342,
    "endMs": 456376,
    "timestampMs": 454342,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "使用时应根据任务选择能力，",
    "startMs": 456376,
    "endMs": 458595,
    "timestampMs": 456376,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "并把 Beta 状态纳入风险评估。",
    "startMs": 458595,
    "endMs": 461554,
    "timestampMs": 458595,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "实际接入时，可以把过程缩成三步。",
    "startMs": 462754,
    "endMs": 465604,
    "timestampMs": 462754,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第一，",
    "startMs": 465604,
    "endMs": 466054,
    "timestampMs": 465604,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "创建 Bash 实例，",
    "startMs": 466054,
    "endMs": 468089,
    "timestampMs": 466054,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "把允许读取的文件、",
    "startMs": 468089,
    "endMs": 469718,
    "timestampMs": 468089,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "初始环境和工作目录交给它。",
    "startMs": 469718,
    "endMs": 472160,
    "timestampMs": 469718,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第二，只注册任务真正需要的命令，并设置执行上限。",
    "startMs": 472160,
    "endMs": 476435,
    "timestampMs": 472160,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "如果需要联网，再显式添加受限的网络配置。",
    "startMs": 476435,
    "endMs": 480099,
    "timestampMs": 476435,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "第三，",
    "startMs": 480099,
    "endMs": 480549,
    "timestampMs": 480099,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "把模型生成的脚本交给 exec，",
    "startMs": 480549,
    "endMs": 483602,
    "timestampMs": 480549,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "读取结构化结果，",
    "startMs": 483602,
    "endMs": 485027,
    "timestampMs": 483602,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而不是让模型直接接触宿主终端。",
    "startMs": 485027,
    "endMs": 487876,
    "timestampMs": 485027,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "对于代码分析，可以使用只读 OverlayFs；",
    "startMs": 487876,
    "endMs": 492355,
    "timestampMs": 487876,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "对于临时数据处理，用 InMemoryFs；",
    "startMs": 492355,
    "endMs": 496426,
    "timestampMs": 492355,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "只有确实需要写盘时，",
    "startMs": 496426,
    "endMs": 498257,
    "timestampMs": 496426,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "才提供范围严格的 ReadWriteFs。",
    "startMs": 498257,
    "endMs": 502328,
    "timestampMs": 498257,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "能力越少，系统越容易推理，也越容易审计。",
    "startMs": 502328,
    "endMs": 505703,
    "timestampMs": 502328,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "总结一下。",
    "startMs": 506903,
    "endMs": 507552,
    "timestampMs": 506903,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "JustBash 的核心不是在 JavaScript 里启动 Bash，",
    "startMs": 507552,
    "endMs": 513233,
    "timestampMs": 507552,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而是把 Shell 拆成解析器、",
    "startMs": 513233,
    "endMs": 515668,
    "timestampMs": 513233,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "AST、",
    "startMs": 515668,
    "endMs": 516155,
    "timestampMs": 515668,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "解释器、",
    "startMs": 516155,
    "endMs": 516642,
    "timestampMs": 516155,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "命令注册表和虚拟文件系统，",
    "startMs": 516642,
    "endMs": 518590,
    "timestampMs": 516642,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "再把网络与资源控制交还给宿主。",
    "startMs": 518590,
    "endMs": 520862,
    "timestampMs": 518590,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "这让 Bash 从一个不可预测的外部进程，",
    "startMs": 520862,
    "endMs": 524108,
    "timestampMs": 520862,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "变成可测试、",
    "startMs": 524108,
    "endMs": 524920,
    "timestampMs": 524108,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "可组合、",
    "startMs": 524920,
    "endMs": 525407,
    "timestampMs": 524920,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "可限制的 Agent 能力。",
    "startMs": 525407,
    "endMs": 527517,
    "timestampMs": 525407,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "如果你正在设计 Agent 的工具层，",
    "startMs": 527517,
    "endMs": 530439,
    "timestampMs": 527517,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "不妨把问题从“怎样安全地执行任意命令”，",
    "startMs": 530439,
    "endMs": 533523,
    "timestampMs": 530439,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "改成“怎样只提供任务真正需要的 Shell 语义”。",
    "startMs": 533523,
    "endMs": 537580,
    "timestampMs": 533523,
    "confidence": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "这就是 JustBash 最值得借鉴的地方。",
    "startMs": 537580,
